deposit
├── caller lacks YIELDMANAGER_ROLE → revert
├── msg.value is zero → revert
└── strategy is operational
    ├── Yearn is shutdown or lacks capacity → revert
    ├── existing principal is underwater beyond bounded share-rounding dust → revert
    ├── only share-rounding dust remains → accept a new deposit
    ├── oracle round is invalid, stale, or cannot be safely normalized → revert
    ├── Curve EMA peg or either independent minimum-output check fails → revert atomically
    ├── BOLD peg deviation within the accepted band → use the peg-plus-execution bound consistently
    ├── either Yearn deposit mints zero shares → revert atomically
    ├── external Yearn supply returns to zero before a donation → reject a zero-share mint without consuming ETH
    └── conversions succeed → book actual st-yBOLD shares and yBOLD principal value
